gle sign-in without removing existing authentication behavior. Add a Google button that calls Supabase signInWithOAuth with provider google and redirects back to /auth/callback. Make /auth/callback complete the PKCE exchangeCodeForSession flow, handle errors, restore the intended destination, and preserve existing email sign-in, sign-up, and session logic. Never put the Google Client Secret, service-role key, SMTP credentials, or Resend key in frontend code.",w4e={tab:"Email Templates",backToList:"Back to email templates",title:"Email templates",description:"Customize the messages sent by this project's authentication flows.",customized:"Customized",default:"Default",subject:"Subject",html:"HTML source",plainText:"Plain text",preview:"Preview",refreshPreview:"Refresh preview",previewLoading:"Rendering preview…",previewEmpty:"Save the draft, then open the preview.",previewSaveFirst:"Save this template draft before previewing it.",previewFailed:"The template preview couldn't be generated.",variables:"Available variables",testTitle:"Send a test email",testDescription:"Send the saved draft through this project's SMTP configuration.",testRequiresSmtp:"Save a valid SMTP configuration before sending a test email.",recipientPlaceholder:"Recipient email",sendTest:"Send test",testSuccess:"Test email sent.",testFailed:"The test email couldn't be sent. Check the SMTP configuration and recipient.",restoreDefault:"Restore default",resetTitle:"Restore the default template?",resetDescription:"This replaces the selected template in the draft only. The active version remains unchanged until you activate the draft.",resetSuccess:"The default template has been restored in the draft.",resetFailed:"The default template couldn't be restored.",saveSuccess:"Template draft saved.",saveFailed:"The template draft couldn't be saved.",unsavedTitle:"Discard unsaved template changes?",unsavedDescription:"Switching templates now will discard your unsaved edits.",discardChanges:"Discard and switch",