ions to their previous state. Later changes block restoration. This creates a new operation and requires a fresh preview and explicit confirmation; it does not restore data or entire databases.",unavailable:"Restoration preview is unavailable for the current capability or database binding.",changed:"Permissions have changed since this operation. Reload and review current permissions.",failed:"Unable to prepare restoration. Reload history and try again.",target:"Restoration target",accept:"I have reviewed the restoration differences and warnings and confirm restoring these permissions."},x_e={option:"{name} — {label}",public:{label:"All roles",description:"Applies to every database role, including anonymous and signed-in users."},anon:{label:"Anonymous access",description:"Used for requests without a signed-in user. Grants and row policies determine access."},authenticated:{label:"Signed-in users",description:"Used for signed-in users. Row policies determine which records each user can access."},postgres:{label:"Database administrator",description:"Database administration role. Actual access depends on its role attributes and grants."},service_role:{label:"Server access",description:"For trusted server requests. Bypasses row-level security (RLS); never expose its key in browser code."},custom:{label:"Other database role",description:"An existing database role. Access depends on its grants and role attributes."}},L_e={title:"Custom roles",notice:"New roles cannot log in or gain admin rights. Users are not assigned automatically. Shared PUBLIC permissions still apply.",denied:"Only the project Owner can manage roles.",create:"Create role",update:"Edit description",delete:"Delete role",name:"Role name",nameRules:"Use up to 48 lowercase letters, numbers or underscores, starting with a letter. System names are reserved.",description:"Description (optional)",deleteNotice:"Revoke grants and resolve object dependencies before deleting. Business objects will not be deleted au