irst site for free in minutes now!",internalTeam:"I can help you turn an idea into a product prototype and export it to Figma for further editing. Create your first site for free in minutes now!",student:"I can help you turn a school project—or any idea—into something real. Describe what you want to build or pick a template. Create your first project for free in minutes now!",general:"I can help you turn any idea into a real project. Describe what you want to build or pick a template. Create your first site for free in minutes now!"}},dDe={summary:"Here’s the project brief I prepared for you:",generationDisplayIntro:"Create the project using this brief and requirement:",brandNameLabel:"Brand name",industryLabel:"Industry",logoLabel:"Logo",referenceWebsitesLabel:"Reference websites",requirementLabel:"Additional requirement",uploadedLogoSummary:"Uploaded logo",generatedLogoSummary:"AI-generated logo",noLogoForNow:"I don't need a logo yet",brandNamePlaceholder:"Enter your brand name",industryPlaceholder:"Select your website industry",referenceWebsitesPlaceholder:"https://example.com",optionalLabel:"(optional)",skipped:"Skipped",uploadLogo:"Upload a logo",uploadingLogo:"Uploading...",generateLogo:"Generate a logo with AI",generatingLogo:"Generating...",generatingLogoCountdown:"Generating {seconds}s",generatedLogo:"AI-generated logo",logoAdded:"Logo added",logoPreviewAlt:"Logo preview",chooseAnotherLogo:"Choose another"},uDe={title:"What are you mainly trying to create?",options:{draft:"Prototype / Demo / Code",businessWebsite:"Business Website",saasSoftware:"SaaS Software / App",onlineStore:"Online Store",other:"Other",otherPlaceholder:"please specify"}},pDe={title:"Which best describes you?",options:{business:"Business Owner",eCommerceSeller:"E-commerce Seller",clientProjects:"Agency / Freelancer",companyProjects:"Company / Internal Team",schoolProjects:"Student",other:"Other",otherPlaceholder:"please specify"},descriptions:{business:"I’m building for my business or br